00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:43.200
People carry EpiPens for bees.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.860
And you know, even though allergies

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:46.720
are more likely to happen early in life,

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.520
they can develop later in life as well.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.700
- [Narrator] But every time
Margaret stings herself,

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:51.960
the honey bee dies.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:52.793
- Yeah.

00:09:52.793 --> 00:09:55.430
- [Narrator] Something
Margaret is all too aware of.

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:56.980
- Every bee is precious.

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.800
I get sad when I watch 'em die.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.420
I prefer to get a older bee.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.970
The younger bees, they've
got their lives ahead of them

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:07.037
and it helps me feel less
guilt about killing the bees.

00:10:07.037 --> 00:10:08.536
(upbeat music)

00:10:08.536 --> 00:10:10.650
- It's a sad situation to
see because I would love

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:12.300
for her to find pain relief in a way

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.220
where it's not damaging to the bees,

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.700
to her mental health and potentially

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.557
gives her, can give her
longer lasting relief

00:10:18.557 --> 00:10:21.290
depending on what the
cause of her arthritis is.

